# Tenant host image variants: the one authoritative image tag -> patch set table.
#
# One variant per line: the image tag (IMAGE_VERSION), then the patch files from this directory that
# the build applies to the pinned wasmCloud source, in order (WASH_PATCHES). Read by:
#   - Dockerfile: the build fails unless WASH_PATCHES is exactly the set listed for IMAGE_VERSION;
#   - .github/workflows/tenant-host-image.yml: the publish job's resolver passes the listed set;
#   - .github/workflows/tenant-host-patch-check.yml: one CI job per line.
# The first line is the canonical tag (the platform default host image). Patch names hold no spaces.
